business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"n_fUROdhfmLwd_mpBi55ew","review_id":"XjuTBNr1ZEtVTK7ewRsb-w","date":"2016-09-07T18:12:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9573743343353271,"text_excerpt":"The muffuletta here is amazing!! Luckily for us there was no line at all and we were in and out in a few minutes. At first you'd think the bread to meat ratio is off, but the bread is so delicious that you won't mind the extra bread. The highlight of the sandwich though is the olive spread that they put in. It goes perfectly well with the meat and adds a different level of deliciousness, differentiating it from a typical deli sandwich. The muffulettas here are huge so you could prob cut it up and share with a couple people. If you're visiting nola, I'd say grab one to go and eat it at the airport (airport food in nola sucks)"},{"business_id":"n_fUROdhfmLwd_mpBi55ew","review_id":"FI6Xe2R4tSlTgeku5EY06Q","date":"2019-02-16T00:06:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9505394697189331,"text_excerpt":"The reason why this muffuletta is so good is because of their amazing olive salad and the soft fluffy bread. There is always a line here and the people in the back seem to be pre-making the sandwiches as people come in to order. This makes the line go by faster. If you're visiting New Orleans, I definitely recommend trying a sandwich here. Boyfriend and I shared a half size which was a good amount of food for the both of us (especially since we planned on walking 5 min down the street for beignets at Cafe Du Monde)."},{"business_id":"n_fUROdhfmLwd_mpBi55ew","review_id":"f3XCY4-YYrWFU9WZzNgrBw","date":"2017-01-13T13:37:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.950093686580658,"text_excerpt":"If you've never been to New Orleans, you haven't really had a Muffuletta. I tried it a couple of times from where i'm from and just never desired it again. But thought I would give the sandwich a try here since this is where it became famous. The combination of right bread, flavorful olive salad, right meats and cheese coming together as they do here, is what I have been missing out. I'm now on a quest to find one like here in my hometown. Central Grocery is a charming place that probably has not had much change in the time since it opened way back when. They crank out these sandwiches and have them ready to go so waiting is not a problem. Just follow the line and wait for the clerk to ca..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"n_fUROdhfmLwd_mpBi55ew","photo_id":"HTbeVBG92IE1apv2ctTnzg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/HTbeVBG92IE1apv2ctTnzg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8336808681488037},{"business_id":"n_fUROdhfmLwd_mpBi55ew","photo_id":"r6aK8JTPFw8E4m98p5Ttvg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/r6aK8JTPFw8E4m98p5Ttvg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8274790644645691},{"business_id":"n_fUROdhfmLwd_mpBi55ew","photo_id":"XHEAUTcu_3vU6XSLj9iE7Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/XHEAUTcu_3vU6XSLj9iE7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.817272424697876},{"business_id":"n_fUROdhfmLwd_mpBi55ew","photo_id":"vFvqIvnws-C4t3v2zzzsUw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vFvqIvnws-C4t3v2zzzsUw.jpg","visual_representati